    "Source": "\/*\r\n    Author or source: antoinec <antoine.champion+dsp@outlook.fr>\r\n*\/\r\n\r\n\/* Averaging filter\r\n * Returns the moving average of the signal \r\n * over a small period of time *\/\r\n\r\nfloat buffer[100] = {0};\r\nint maxSamples = 99;\r\nint writePtr = 0;\r\nfloat sum = 0;\r\n\r\nformula_main {\r\n    float highpass = SWITCH_1;\r\n    int numSamples = 1 + KNOB_1 * (maxSamples - 1);\r\n    \r\n    sum -= buffer[writePtr];\r\n    buffer[writePtr] = input;\r\n    sum += buffer[writePtr++];\r\n    \r\n    if (writePtr > numSamples) {\r\n        writePtr = 0;  \r\n    }    \r\n\r\n    float output = sum \/ (numSamples + 1);\r\n    \r\n    if (highpass) {\r\n        output = input - output;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    return output;\r\n}\r\n",
